      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FOXY JAY (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (26.18) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including six wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can atone. TWILIGHT TORI (7) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 390m behind Frenzy (22.84) in a Grade 5. Can figure in the finish. DUNDEE REX (6) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Was a strong winner last time (19.52) over 350m at Healesville in a Grade 5. Goes very well at the journey winning four races. Leading chance again. BERRINGA PADDY (2) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
